---
const piezas = [
  { x: 0, y: 0, color: '#FF7A59', desde: 'translate(-40px,-40px) rotate(-40deg)' },
  { x: 30, y: 0, color: '#FF6FAE', desde: 'translate(40px,-40px) rotate(40deg)' },
  { x: 0, y: 30, color: '#0FB5BA', desde: 'translate(-40px,40px) rotate(30deg)' },
  { x: 30, y: 30, color: '#FFC94D', desde: 'translate(40px,40px) rotate(-30deg)' },
];
---

<section class="gustos">
  <div class="contenedor">
    <span class="etiqueta reveal">Un poquito de mí</span>
    <h2 class="reveal d1">Me gustan…</h2>
    <div class="tarjetas">

      <article class="tarjeta reveal d1" style="--c:#e3f7f6">
        <svg class="libro" viewBox="0 0 80 64" width="96" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M40 14 C30 8 16 8 4 10 V54 C16 52 30 52 40 58Z" fill="#0FB5BA" />
          <path d="M40 14 C50 8 64 8 76 10 V54 C64 52 50 52 40 58Z" fill="#0A6E8A" />
          <path d="M40 16 C31 11 19 11 8 13 V50 C19 48 31 49 40 54Z" fill="#fff" />
          <path d="M40 16 C49 11 61 11 72 13 V50 C61 48 49 49 40 54Z" fill="#fff" />
          <path class="pagina p1" d="M40 16 C49 11 61 11 72 13 V50 C61 48 49 49 40 54Z" fill="#FFE3EF" stroke="#FFC2DD" />
          <path class="pagina p2" d="M40 16 C49 11 61 11 72 13 V50 C61 48 49 49 40 54Z" fill="#FFF6D6" stroke="#FFE27A" />
          <path d="M14 22 C20 21 28 22 34 24 M14 30 C20 29 28 30 34 32 M14 38 C20 37 28 38 34 40" stroke="#bfe9e7" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
        </svg>
        <span class="vuela v1" aria-hidden="true">⭐</span>
        <span class="vuela v2" aria-hidden="true">🐚</span>
        <h3>los libros</h3>
        <p>Cuentos de islas, océanos y aventuras.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="tarjeta reveal d2" style="--c:#ffe9e2; animation-delay:-1.5s">
        <svg class="puzzle" viewBox="-8 -8 76 76" width="96" aria-hidden="true">
          {piezas.map((p, i) => (
            <g class="pieza" style={`--desde:${p.desde}; animation-delay:${i * 0.25}s`}>
              <rect x={p.x} y={p.y} width="28" height="28" rx="6" fill={p.color} />
              <circle cx={p.x + 14} cy={p.y + 14} r="4" fill="#fff" opacity=".45" />
            </g>
          ))}
        </svg>
        <span class="vuela v1" aria-hidden="true">✨</span>
        <span class="vuela v2" aria-hidden="true">🧩</span>
        <h3>los rompecabezas</h3>
        <p>¡Pieza por pieza hasta completarlo!</p>
      </article>

      <article class="tarjeta reveal d1" style="--c:#ffe4f0; animation-delay:-0.8s">
        <svg class="corazon" viewBox="0 0 80 72" width="96" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M40 64 C22 52 6 40 6 25 C6 14 14 6 24 6 C30 6 36 9 40 15 C44 9 50 6 56 6 C66 6 74 14 74 25 C74 40 58 52 40 64Z" fill="#FF6FAE"/>
          <path d="M18 20 Q22 14 28 16" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".5"/>
          <circle cx="32" cy="38" r="5" fill="#fff" opacity=".2"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="vuela v1" aria-hidden="true">💕</span>
        <span class="vuela v2" aria-hidden="true">🌸</span>
        <h3>el color rosa</h3>
        <p>¡Todo lo bonito tiene que ser rosado!</p>
      </article>

      <article class="tarjeta reveal d2" style="--c:#dbeeff; animation-delay:-2.2s">
        <svg class="perrito" viewBox="0 0 80 80" width="96" aria-hidden="true">
          <ellipse cx="21" cy="20" rx="11" ry="15" fill="#3B8FCC" transform="rotate(-15 21 20)"/>
          <ellipse cx="59" cy="20" rx="11" ry="15" fill="#3B8FCC" transform="rotate(15 59 20)"/>
          <ellipse cx="21" cy="20" rx="6" ry="9" fill="#C8E8F8" transform="rotate(-15 21 20)"/>
          <ellipse cx="59" cy="20" rx="6" ry="9" fill="#C8E8F8" transform="rotate(15 59 20)"/>
          <ellipse cx="40" cy="44" rx="26" ry="24" fill="#5BAFE8"/>
          <ellipse cx="29" cy="39" rx="8" ry="9" fill="#fff"/>
          <ellipse cx="51" cy="39" rx="8" ry="9" fill="#fff"/>
          <circle cx="30" cy="40" r="5" fill="#1a1a2e"/>
          <circle cx="52" cy="40" r="5" fill="#1a1a2e"/>
          <circle cx="31" cy="38" r="2" fill="#fff"/>
          <circle cx="53" cy="38" r="2" fill="#fff"/>
          <ellipse cx="40" cy="51" rx="6" ry="4" fill="#1a1a2e"/>
          <path d="M33 58 Q40 65 47 58" stroke="#1a1a2e" stroke-width="2.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="vuela v1" aria-hidden="true">🐾</span>
        <span class="vuela v2" aria-hidden="true">💙</span>
        <h3>Bluey</h3>
        <p>Mi perrita favorita de dibujos animados.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="tarjeta reveal d1" style="--c:#ede9ff; animation-delay:-1.1s">
        <svg class="dado" viewBox="0 0 80 80" width="96" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect x="6" y="6" width="68" height="68" rx="16" fill="#7C5CFC"/>
          <rect x="9" y="9" width="62" height="62" rx="13" fill="#A78BFA"/>
          <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="7" fill="#fff"/>
          <circle cx="56" cy="24" r="7" fill="#fff"/>
          <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="7" fill="#fff"/>
          <circle cx="24" cy="56" r="7" fill="#fff"/>
          <circle cx="56" cy="56" r="7" fill="#fff"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="vuela v1" aria-hidden="true">🎲</span>
        <span class="vuela v2" aria-hidden="true">🃏</span>
        <h3>juegos de mesa</h3>
        <p>Jugar en familia es lo mejor del mundo.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="tarjeta reveal d2" style="--c:#fffadc; animation-delay:-0.4s">
        <svg class="estrella" viewBox="0 0 80 80" width="96" aria-hidden="true">
          <polygon points="40,5 48,28 72,28 53,43 60,67 40,52 20,67 27,43 8,28 32,28" fill="#FF6FAE"/>
          <polygon points="40,13 46,30 64,30 51,41 56,58 40,47 24,58 29,41 16,30 34,30" fill="#FFB3D9"/>
          <circle cx="40" cy="37" r="6" fill="#fff" opacity=".55"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="vuela v1" aria-hidden="true">🌟</span>
        <span class="vuela v2" aria-hidden="true">🩷</span>
        <h3>los stickers</h3>
        <p>¡Coleccionar y pegar stickers es mi pasión!</p>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .gustos { text-align: center; }
  .tarjetas { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; margin-top: 24px; }
  .tarjeta {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--c); border-radius: var(--radio); padding: 28px 14px 24px;
    animation: balancear 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: scale .3s cubic-bezier(.3,1.6,.5,1);
  }
  .tarjeta:hover, .tarjeta:active { scale: 1.06; }
  .tarjeta h3 { font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--profundo); margin: 12px 0 6px; }
  .tarjeta p { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--suave); line-height: 1.45; }

  /* Libro: páginas que se pasan */
  .libro { animation: flotar 3s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .pagina { transform-origin: 40px 34px; animation: pasar 3s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .p2 { animation-delay: 1.5s; }
  @keyframes pasar {
    0%, 10% { transform: scaleX(1); }
    50%, 100% { transform: scaleX(-1); }
  }

  /* Rompecabezas que se arma solo */
  .pieza {
    transform-box: fill-box; transform-origin: center;
    animation: armar 4s cubic-bezier(.3,1.4,.5,1) infinite;
  }
  @keyframes armar {
    0% { transform: var(--desde) scale(.4); opacity: 0; }
    22%, 70% { transform: none; opacity: 1; }
    78% { transform: scale(1.12); }
    86% { transform: none; opacity: 1; }
    100% { transform: var(--desde) scale(.4); opacity: 0; }
  }

  /* Corazón que late */
  .corazon { animation: latido 1.4s ease-in-out infinite; transform-origin: center; }

  /* Perrito flotando */
  .perrito { animation: flotar 3s ease-in-out infinite; }

  /* Dado que se menea */
  .dado {
    transform-origin: center;
    animation: menear 3s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  /* Estrella que gira suavemente */
  .estrella {
    transform-origin: center;
    animation: girar 6s linear infinite;
  }

  .vuela { position: absolute; font-size: 18px; animation: titilarG 2.6s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .v1 { top: 14px; right: 16px; }
  .v2 { top: 34px; left: 14px; animation-delay: -1.3s; }
  @keyframes titilarG {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) scale(.8) rotate(-10deg); opacity: .5; }
    50% { transform: translateY(-12px) scale(1.15) rotate(10deg); opacity: 1; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 360px) { .tarjetas { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
